Error [E1307]: subcommand variant `Serve` doesn't carry a `#[CLI]` struct
  --> tests/ui/cli_subcommand_payload_not_cli.jet:6:5
    |
  6 |     Serve(PlainArgs)
    |     ^^^^^
 Why: each subcommand variant's payload is a single `#[CLI]`-derived struct — that struct is where the subcommand's own flags come from.
 Fix: give `Serve` a single `#[CLI]` struct payload, e.g. `Serve(SomeArgs)`
